            "textcontent_7qbupvoyq8v_html": "Phoenix Gravity Su Filtreleri olarak, size en saf i\u00e7me suyunu sunmak i\u00e7in onlarca y\u0131ll\u0131k inovasyondan yararlan\u0131yoruz.",
            "marquee_text0_7ifwlcyvjse_html": "99 \u00a3 \u00fczeri al\u0131\u015fveri\u015flerde \u00fccretsiz Birle\u015fik Krall\u0131k teslimat\u0131",
