            "countdown_title_pcwqxqbwi5_html": "Acele edin! Sat\u0131\u015f \u015fu tarihte sona erecek:",
            "no_product_item_pcwqxqbwi5_html": "Hen\u00fcz \u00fcr\u00fcn bulunmamaktad\u0131r!",
            "marquee_text0_zok3xyenm9_html": " 99 \u00a3 \u00fczeri al\u0131\u015fveri\u015flerde \u00fccretsiz Birle\u015fik Krall\u0131k teslimat\u0131",
            "marquee_text1_zok3xyenm9_html": " Kirleticilerin %99,99'u giderildi",
            "textcontent_gdfqmr8h93h_html": "Kartu\u015f de\u011fi\u015ftirme zaman\u0131 m\u0131 geldi? Do\u011fru yerdesiniz. Ak\u0131ll\u0131 Karbon Kartu\u015flar\u0131, kirleticilerin %99,99'unu filtrelemek i\u00e7in en y\u00fcksek kaliteli hindistan cevizi kabu\u011fu bazl\u0131 aktif karbon kullan\u0131r.",
            "headingtext_w17vtj9msw_html": "<p> Phoenix Yer\u00e7ekimi Sistemi'nin tamam\u0131n\u0131 m\u0131 ar\u0131yorsunuz? <a href=\"\/products\/the-phoenix-gravity-water-filter\" target=\"_blank\"><font color=\"#f1d14e\">Buradan bulabilirsiniz.<\/font><\/a><\/p>",
            "textcontent_33ebkzclo6v_html": "\"Abone Ol &amp; Tasarruf Et\" indirimi sepette uygulanacakt\u0131r.",
            "add_to_cart_q0w89xz74i_html": "EKLEMEK",
            "pre_order_q0w89xz74i_html": "\u00d6n Sipari\u015f",
            "product_unavailable_q0w89xz74i_html": "Mevcut de\u011fil",
            "out_stock_q0w89xz74i_html": "Stoklar t\u00fckendi",
            "added_cart_text_q0w89xz74i_html": "EKLEMEK",
            "added_cart_message_q0w89xz74i_html": "Sepete eklendi",
            "headingtext_tewlld6ill_html": "Kutuda neler var?",
            "headingtext_a6trs2n2jv_html": "\u0130ste\u011fe ba\u011fl\u0131 ekstralar:",
            "text_week_pcwqxqbwi5_html": "[%-W] hafta%!W",
            "text_day_pcwqxqbwi5_html": "[%-g] g\u00fcn%!G",
            "text_hour_pcwqxqbwi5_html": "[%-H] saat%!H",
