            "text1_wxolqz1d3vn_html": "Uykuyu iyile\u015ftirir ve\n g\u00fc\u00e7lendirmeye yard\u0131mc\u0131 olabilir\n kaslar.",
            "headingtext_lsg9dljy6tc_html": "\u0130\u015fte b\u00f6yle oluyor.",
            "ecomiconlisttitle0_ecom03x8rtw7537j_03x8rtw7537j_html": "Taze, besin a\u00e7\u0131s\u0131ndan zengin su, akarsulardan kamusal su sistemlerine ak\u0131yor.",
            "ecomiconlisttitle0_ecomy6ptbw4krbq_y6ptbw4krbq_html": "A\u011f\u0131r metaller, parazitler, kimyasal at\u0131klar, pestisitler ve daha fazlas\u0131 dahil olmak \u00fczere kirleticilere maruz kalmaktad\u0131r",
            "ecomiconlisttitle0_ecomp9nn9tgnyoo_p9nn9tgnyoo_html": "Phoenix Yer\u00e7ekimi Filtresi, en y\u00fcksek kaliteli hindistan cevizi kabuklar\u0131ndan \u00fcretilen aktif karbon kartu\u015flar\u0131 arac\u0131l\u0131\u011f\u0131yla musluk suyunu ar\u0131t\u0131r",
            "ecomiconlisttitle0_ecomsgfy8pvl59o_sgfy8pvl59o_html": "Yo\u011fun, g\u00f6zenekli duvar, suyunuzun oksijen veya mineral i\u00e7eri\u011fini de\u011fi\u015ftirmeden kirleticilerin %99,99'unu giderir",
            "ecomiconlisttitle0_ecomjev1lfa4xx_jev1lfa4xx_html": "Siz ve sevdikleriniz, t\u0131pk\u0131 do\u011fan\u0131n tasarlad\u0131\u011f\u0131 gibi, taze ve besin de\u011feri y\u00fcksek suyun tad\u0131n\u0131 kolayca \u00e7\u0131kar\u0131n.",
            "headingtext_x7iy6nag3sf_html": "Size daha sa\u011fl\u0131kl\u0131 bir hidrasyon sa\u011flar",
            "ecomiconlisttitle0_ecomemdqpbm42dk_emdqpbm42dk_html": "H\u00fccre yenilenmesine yard\u0131mc\u0131 olarak ya\u015flanma s\u00fcrecini yava\u015flat\u0131r",
            "ecomiconlisttitle1_ecomemdqpbm42dk_emdqpbm42dk_html": "S\u0131cakl\u0131k d\u00fczenlemesini optimize ederek daha iyi uykuyu destekler",
            "ecomiconlisttitle2_ecomemdqpbm42dk_emdqpbm42dk_html": "Toksinleri temizleyerek cildi, sa\u00e7\u0131 ve t\u0131rnaklar\u0131 iyile\u015ftirir",
            "ecomiconlisttitle3_ecomemdqpbm42dk_emdqpbm42dk_html": "Beyninize \u00f6nemli besinleri ta\u015f\u0131yarak bili\u015fsel i\u015flevi geli\u015ftirir",
            "ecomiconlisttitle4_ecomemdqpbm42dk_emdqpbm42dk_html": "Kan ak\u0131\u015f\u0131n\u0131 iyile\u015ftirerek hastal\u0131klar\u0131 azalt\u0131r",
            "headingtext_ihj9ng6k9hn_html": "Size daha sa\u011fl\u0131kl\u0131 bir hidrasyon sa\u011flar",
