            "textcontent_j7tduu5lxkq_html": "En y\u00fcksek kaliteli paslanmaz \u00e7elik",
            "textcontent_6fl85zdi1s7_html": "Do\u011fal aktif karbon filtrasyonu",
            "textcontent_q5gdtukeli_html": "Gezegen dostu ar\u0131tma",
