            "textcontent_6fa0qdifa86_html": "10 y\u0131l garanti, 100 g\u00fcn para iade garantisi ",
            "headingtext_g11wgboq69e_html": "Daha sa\u011fl\u0131kl\u0131 s\u0131v\u0131 t\u00fcketimine merhaba deyin.",
            "headingtext_ucxpntowfx_html": "Phoenix Gravity Su Filtresi\n",
            "buttoncontent_ci5uuaphq6r_html": "Bedeninize g\u00f6re al\u0131\u015fveri\u015f yap\u0131n",
            "headingtext_fzqc9m2ioup_html": "Ak\u0131ll\u0131 Karbon Kartu\u015flar\u0131\n",
            "buttoncontent_y3w7rtreas_html": "Kartu\u015flar\u0131n\u0131z\u0131 se\u00e7in",
            "headingtext_cgaiktrtrpi_html": "Suyu i\u00e7menin daha do\u011fal bir yolu.",
            "text0_8ack06n0lqi_html": "Su filtrenizi be\u011fenmezseniz 100 g\u00fcn i\u00e7erisinde paran\u0131z\u0131n tamam\u0131n\u0131 iade ediyoruz.",
            "buttoncontent_s0wbbr81o6_html": "\u0130ade politikasi",
            "headingtext_moe14bitija_html": "Sa\u011fl\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131z ancak suyunuz kadar iyi olabilir.<div><\/div>",
            "textcontent_yhdbpi7fg1r_html": "Bize her zaman daha fazla su i\u00e7memiz gerekti\u011fi s\u00f6ylenir, peki bunun ger\u00e7ekte ne i\u015fe yarad\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 biliyor musunuz?<div><br><\/div><div> \u0130\u00e7ti\u011finiz suyun kalitesi, uykunuzun, cildinizin, sa\u00e7\u0131n\u0131z\u0131n, ba\u011f\u0131\u015f\u0131kl\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131z\u0131n, beyin g\u00fcc\u00fcn\u00fcz\u00fcn, sa\u011fl\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131z\u0131n ve \u00e7ok daha fazlas\u0131n\u0131n kalitesini etkiler. V\u00fccudunuzun %60'\u0131 sudan olu\u015fur, i\u00e7ti\u011finiz su da size ba\u011fl\u0131d\u0131r.<br>\n<\/div><div><div><div><div><br><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div>",
            "headingtext_rkhk2gau3pe_html": "Ancak besin a\u00e7\u0131s\u0131ndan zengin, saf olmayan su her zaman muslukta bulunmuyor.<div><\/div>",
            "headingtext_5whg2vchcbb_html": "Phoenix Gravity Su Filtreleri hangi kirleri temizler?",
            "name0_cjwfins9og7_html": "mikroplastikler",
            "title0_cjwfins9og7_html": "%99",
            "name1_cjwfins9og7_html": "a\u011f\u0131r metaller",
            "title1_cjwfins9og7_html": "%99,9",
            "name2_cjwfins9og7_html": "PFA'lar",
            "title2_cjwfins9og7_html": "%95",
            "name3_cjwfins9og7_html": "pestisitler",
            "title3_cjwfins9og7_html": "%99",
            "name4_cjwfins9og7_html": "giardia kistleri",
            "title4_cjwfins9og7_html": "%99,99",
            "name5_cjwfins9og7_html": "Vir\u00fcsler",
