            "title8_cjwfins9og7_html": "%99",
            "headingtext_mevk83v2cg_html": "\u0130\u015fte Nas\u0131l \u00c7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r",
            "headingtext_jgoqkzp4vhm_html": "Muslukta tadabilece\u011finiz daha iyi kalite",
            "buttoncontent_76d19r2d2t_html": "Evet l\u00fctfen!",
            "headingtext_vkmaqerxxy_html": "Su ihtiyac\u0131n\u0131z i\u00e7in buraday\u0131z.",
            "textcontent_mxtgphkfi1_html": "<b>Harika tad\u0131 olan, saf olmayan<\/b> suyun,\n Temel bir hakt\u0131r; bir ayr\u0131cal\u0131k de\u011fil. D\u00fcnyan\u0131n \u00f6nde gelen yer\u00e7ekimli su filtreleri \u00fcreticisi olarak, <b>daha sa\u011fl\u0131kl\u0131 s\u0131v\u0131 al\u0131m\u0131n\u0131<\/b> herkes i\u00e7in eri\u015filebilir k\u0131lma misyonunday\u0131z.<div><br><\/div>\n<div> en \u00e7ok ihtiya\u00e7 duyduklar\u0131 her yerde.\n Ayr\u0131ca biz de okulun en ya\u015fl\u0131 \u00e7ocuklar\u0131ndan biriyiz.\n blok, suyu do\u011frudan kayna\u011f\u0131na geri getiriyor<b>\n<\/b> 1978'den beri <b>kaynak safl\u0131\u011f\u0131<\/b> .<div><div><br><\/div><\/div>\n<\/div>",
            "buttoncontent_byenycgxa9_html": "Hikayemizi Okuyun",
            "headingtext_t0u1977v2h_html": "Su i\u00e7menin tam da olmas\u0131 gerekti\u011fi gibi oldu\u011funu kabul edin.",
            "buttoncontent_52ih3ryffny_html": "\u015eimdi Sat\u0131n Al",
            "headingtext_4vucrif9yhu_html": "Phoenix Fark\u0131",
            "headingtext_o09n267yws_html": "Do\u011frudan kaynaktan(lar)",
            "text0_1bdm5v211uqi_html": "\"Bak\u0131m\u0131 kolay, yap\u0131m\u0131 kolay, uzun \u00f6m\u00fcrl\u00fc ve etkili, sa\u011flam bir filtre ar\u0131yorduk. Her a\u00e7\u0131dan beklentileri kar\u015f\u0131l\u0131yor!\"",
            "text1_1bdm5v211uqi_html": "\"Bunu birka\u00e7 ayd\u0131r kullan\u0131yorum. M\u00fckemmel \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131yor. Hen\u00fcz filtreleri de\u011fi\u015ftirmem gerekmedi. Kalitesi kesinlikle yeterince iyi.\n \u201d",
            "name1_1bdm5v211uqi_html": "Meketrex Yalvaranlar\u0131n\u0131n Sonuncusu",
            "text2_1bdm5v211uqi_html": "\u201c\u0130yi yap\u0131lm\u0131\u015f bir \u00fcnite, montaj\u0131 kolay, makul filtrasyon oran\u0131, di\u011fer gran\u00fcl aktif karbon filtrelerine k\u0131yasla paras\u0131n\u0131n kar\u015f\u0131l\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 iyi veriyor.\u201d",
            "text3_1bdm5v211uqi_html": "\"D\u00fc\u015f\u00fcnd\u00fc\u011f\u00fcmden \u00e7ok daha iyi. Ger\u00e7ekten g\u00fczel g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcyor, \u00e7ok sa\u011flam ve su \u00e7ok yumu\u015fak. Ke\u015fke y\u0131llar \u00f6nce bir tane alsayd\u0131m.\"",
            "headingtext_8i6q4yzc5ai_html": "<u>Ba\u011flant\u0131da Kal\u0131n.<\/u>"
        },
