        "ecom-preview-product-product": {
            "buttoncontent_38tlp4a9m3d_html": "Sat\u0131n Alma \u0130\u015flemini Tamamla",
            "headingtext_v8fzm9br0li_html": "Flor\u00fcr Giderimi i\u00e7in POSTreat'i edinin",
            "textcontent_30mouwwlnx7_html": "<ul>\n<li>Ek POSTreat filtremiz 100'den fazla sorunu ortadan kald\u0131r\u0131r\n Y\u00fcksek hedefli filtrasyon i\u00e7in %95 flor\u00fcr<\/li>\n<li> Phoenix Yer\u00e7ekimi Filtreleri ile birlikte \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r\n 304 kalite paslanmaz \u00e7elik<\/li>\n<li> Maksimum yeniden kullan\u0131m i\u00e7in tasarlanm\u0131\u015f, piyasadaki ilk\n yeniden doldurulabilir \u00e7evre dostu malzemelerle<br>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>",
            "buttoncontent_avza4jhslqk_html": "\u015eimdi sat\u0131n al",
            "buttoncontent_0d9gnsynhbgs_html": "\u015eimdi sat\u0131n al",
            "headingtext_huq74erwh3_html": "Kirleticiler Kald\u0131r\u0131ld\u0131",
