            "title8_05akrhso0zb_html": "%99",
            "headingtext_jzmt4u62ivi_html": "100 g\u00fcnl\u00fck deneme s\u00fcremiz nas\u0131l i\u015fliyor?",
            "textcontent_5vtfq9xu1nk_html": "<ul>\n<li>Phoenix Gravity sistemini sat\u0131n al\u0131n.<\/li>\n<li> Sistemi tam 100 g\u00fcn kullan\u0131n.<\/li>\n<li> En lezzetli suyu alamazsan\u0131z, tam para iadesi i\u00e7in bize geri g\u00f6nderin - soru sorulmaz.<\/li>\n<\/ul><p> * 100 g\u00fcnl\u00fck \u00fccretsiz deneme i\u00e7in <a href=\"https:\/pages\/100-day-trial\" target=\"_blank\">\u015fartlar ve ko\u015fullar<\/a> .<\/p>",
            "headingtext_wjdalt0drbq_html": "SSS",
            "item_title_0_obyhwb3w3en_html": "Hangi boyut filtre benim i\u00e7in en iyisidir?",
            "item_title_1_obyhwb3w3en_html": "Filtremi temizleyebilir miyim?",
            "item_title_2_obyhwb3w3en_html": "Kendim kurabilir miyim?",
            "item_title_3_obyhwb3w3en_html": "Phoenix Gravity Filtresi plastik s\u00fcrahiler veya di\u011fer filtrelerle kar\u015f\u0131la\u015ft\u0131r\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda nas\u0131ld\u0131r?",
            "textcontent_gg1isp4q3jm_html": "Bu, Phoenix Gravity Su Filtrenizi ka\u00e7 ki\u015finin kullanaca\u011f\u0131na ba\u011fl\u0131d\u0131r ve\n Ne kadar su i\u00e7ti\u011finizi d\u00fc\u015f\u00fcn\u00fcn! Genel olarak \u015funlar\u0131 \u00f6neriyoruz:<div> 6 Litre - 1-2 ki\u015fiye kadar m\u00fckemmel uyum<\/div><div> 8 Litre - Ortada, 2-4 ki\u015fiye kadar<\/div><div> 12 Litre - Aile dostu, 3-4+ ki\u015fi i\u00e7in<div><\/div>\n<\/div>",
            "textcontent_lgtnfy638n_html": "<b>Yer\u00e7ekimi Filtresi:<\/b> Il\u0131k sabunlu su ve a\u015f\u0131nd\u0131r\u0131c\u0131 olmayan bir bez veya s\u00fcnger kullanarak elde y\u0131kaman\u0131z\u0131 \u00f6neririz. Ard\u0131ndan, havayla kurumaya b\u0131rak\u0131n veya mikrofiber bir bezle parlat\u0131n. (\u00d6nce kartu\u015flar\u0131n\u0131z\u0131 \u00e7\u0131karmay\u0131 unutmay\u0131n!)<div><br><\/div><div> <b>Kartu\u015flar:<\/b> Bunlar\u0131 yaln\u0131zca so\u011fuk akan su alt\u0131nda y\u0131kay\u0131n ve hafif a\u015f\u0131nd\u0131r\u0131c\u0131 bir ovma teli veya f\u0131r\u00e7a kullanarak, kirlenmeyi \u00f6nlemek i\u00e7in yaln\u0131zca yuvadan uca do\u011fru kartu\u015flar\u0131 hafif\u00e7e masaj yap\u0131n.<\/div><div><br><\/div><div> <b>POSTreat:<\/b> Yine \u0131l\u0131k sabunlu su ve a\u015f\u0131nd\u0131r\u0131c\u0131 olmayan bir bez\/s\u00fcnger kullan\u0131n. Ard\u0131ndan, havayla kurumaya b\u0131rak\u0131n veya mikrofiber bir bezle parlat\u0131n. (\u00d6nce medyay\u0131 \u00e7\u0131karmay\u0131 unutmay\u0131n!)<div> <a href=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0735\/1821\/9557\/files\/Phoenix_Gravity___Carbon_cartridge.pdf?v=1693476936\"><font color=\"#f1d14e\"><\/font><\/a>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>",
            "textcontent_qbh7mgpg8xr_html": "Elbette! Sistemlerimiz son derece kolay monte edilecek \u015fekilde tasarlanm\u0131\u015ft\u0131r ve ihtiyac\u0131n\u0131z olan her \u015fey dahildir. Sadece ellerinizi kullanarak kendiniz yapabilirsiniz; \u00f6zel aletlere, tesisat\u00e7\u0131lara veya elektrik\u00e7ilere ihtiyac\u0131n\u0131z yoktur.<div><br><\/div><div> Her \u00fcniteye eksiksiz talimatlar ekliyoruz ve her zaman yard\u0131mc\u0131 olmak i\u00e7in buraday\u0131z. Bizimle <a href=\"\/pages\/help-center\"><font color=\"#f1d14e\">buradan ileti\u015fime ge\u00e7ebilirsiniz.<\/font><\/a><a href=\"\/pages\/help-center\"><font color=\"#f1d14e\"><\/font><\/a>\n<\/div>",
            "headingtext_tzqc57ieinj_html": "Hala akl\u0131n\u0131za tak\u0131lan bir soru mu var? T\u00fcm <a href=\"\/pages\/faq\" target=\"_blank\">SSS'lerimize<\/a> buradan ula\u015fabilirsiniz.",
            "headingtext_7bpbp2qnqtf_html": "Phoenix fark\u0131, do\u011frudan kaynaktan.",
            "product_single_sale_text_lqniyea3l3c_html": "Sat\u0131\u015f fiyat\u0131}%",
            "product_single_sold_text_lqniyea3l3c_html": "Hepsi sat\u0131ld\u0131",
            "view_more_text_0odul5bqmpyh_html": "Daha fazlas\u0131n\u0131 g\u00f6r\u00fcnt\u00fcle",
            "view_less_text_0odul5bqmpyh_html": "Daha az g\u00f6r\u00fcnt\u00fcle",
            "marquee_text0_xl95rkcfyc_html": " 100 g\u00fcnl\u00fck para iade garantisi",
            "marquee_text1_xl95rkcfyc_html": " 99 \u00a3 \u00fczeri al\u0131\u015fveri\u015flerde \u00fccretsiz teslimat",
            "marquee_text2_xl95rkcfyc_html": " %99,99 oran\u0131nda kirletici madde giderildi",
            "textcontent_cnk4unyr3s_html": "Geli\u015fmi\u015f ve s\u00fcrd\u00fcr\u00fclebilir yer\u00e7ekimi filtrasyonu, v\u00fccudunuzun ihtiya\u00e7 duydu\u011fu besinleri korurken <strong>mikroplastikler de dahil olmak \u00fczere kirleticilerin %99,99'unu<\/strong> giderir.",
            "add_to_cart_kqo0n8ldzo_html": "EKLEMEK",
            "pre_order_kqo0n8ldzo_html": "\u00d6n Sipari\u015f",
            "product_unavailable_kqo0n8ldzo_html": "Mevcut de\u011fil",
            "out_stock_kqo0n8ldzo_html": "Stokta yok",
            "added_cart_text_kqo0n8ldzo_html": "EKLEMEK",
