            "headingtext_tewlld6ill_html": "Kutuda neler var?",
            "textcontent_0yff2xr1comb_html": "<ul>\n<li> 1 Litre kapasiteli 1 x 304 dereceli Paslanmaz \u00c7elik g\u00f6vde \u00fcnitesi<\/li>\n<li><div> 1 x En y\u00fcksek kaliteli Hindistan cevizi kabuklar\u0131ndan yap\u0131lm\u0131\u015f Aktif Karbon kartu\u015fu (CTC 60)<\/div><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<div><\/div>",
            "headingtext_a6trs2n2jv_html": "Arad\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131z \u015fey \u015fu olabilir:",
            "buttoncontent_zczcj6njny_html": "EKLEMEK",
            "buttoncontent_65asjrmppev_html": "EKLEMEK",
            "buttoncontent_nkuzyhl270i_html": "EKLEMEK",
            "buttoncontent_x1kijyfnpoc_html": "EKLEMEK",
            "ecomiconlisttitle0_ecomf34fru6hip5_f34fru6hip5_html": "100 g\u00fcnl\u00fck para iade garantisi ve 10 y\u0131l garanti",
            "title0_0kgkby7rknxk_html": "Besinlerin %100'\u00fcn\u00fc korur",
            "title1_0kgkby7rknxk_html": "Seyahat halindeyken ar\u0131nma i\u00e7in seyahat dostu",
            "title2_0kgkby7rknxk_html": "Dayan\u0131kl\u0131l\u0131k i\u00e7in tasarlanm\u0131\u015f 304 kalite paslanmaz \u00e7elik",
            "title3_0kgkby7rknxk_html": "Daha az at\u0131k, daha az yeniden doldurma, daha d\u00fc\u015f\u00fck maliyet",
            "title4_0kgkby7rknxk_html": "40+ y\u0131ld\u0131r g\u00fcvenebilece\u011finiz daha iyi tat",
            "headingtext_cvz8v5zrwif_html": "\u00dcr\u00fcn A\u00e7\u0131klamas\u0131:",
            "textcontent_21o5ex9rkw6j_html": "<ul>\n<li> Phoenix Gravity Mini'nin kurulumu 10 dakikadan k\u0131sa bir s\u00fcrede kolayca yap\u0131labilir.\n\n<\/li>\n<li> 304 kalite paslanmaz \u00e7elikten \u00fcretilmi\u015f olup, do\u011fal olarak toksin i\u00e7ermez, BPA i\u00e7ermez, s\u0131zd\u0131rmaz.\n\n<\/li>\n<li> Bakteri olu\u015fumunu \u00f6nlemek i\u00e7in g\u00fcm\u00fc\u015fle emdirilmi\u015ftir.\n\n<\/li>\n<li> Piyasadaki en etkili, s\u00fcrd\u00fcr\u00fclebilir ve dayan\u0131kl\u0131 filtrasyon i\u00e7in do\u011fal yer \u00e7ekimi kuvvetini modern teknoloji ve en y\u00fcksek kalitede \u00e7evre dostu malzemelerle birle\u015ftirir.\n<br>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>",
            "textcontent_fcg8fvq2dfd_html": "<ul>\n<li> Seyahatlerinizde yan\u0131n\u0131zda ta\u015f\u0131man\u0131z i\u00e7in m\u00fckemmel, her zaman 1 litreye kadar kaynak suyu tutabilir.\n\n<\/li>\n<li> En y\u00fcksek kalitedeki Hindistan cevizi kabuklar\u0131ndan (CTC 60) \u00fcretilen aktif \u00fc\u00e7 a\u015famal\u0131 karbon filtreler, v\u00fccudunuzun ihtiya\u00e7 duydu\u011fu besinlerin %100'\u00fcn\u00fc korurken kirleticilerin %99,99'unu giderir.\n\n<\/li>\n<li> Kartu\u015flar\u0131m\u0131z, s\u00fcrahi filtrelerden 20 kat daha k\u00fc\u00e7\u00fck fiziksel kirleticileri hapseden aktif karbon blo\u011fu kullan\u0131r.\n<br>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>",
            "headingtext_7wggpvb2b3y_html": "Dayan\u0131kl\u0131l\u0131k i\u00e7in tasarland\u0131",
            "textcontent_0ioshksnajgv_html": "<ul> <li>Plastik filtrelerin aksine, Phoenix Gravity'nin 304 dereceli paslanmaz \u00e7elik g\u00f6vdesi suyunuza toksin, poli\u00fcretan, mikroplastik veya zararl\u0131 kimyasallar s\u0131zd\u0131rmaz.\n\n<\/li>\n<li> G\u00fcnl\u00fck kullan\u0131m\u0131n zorluklar\u0131na 10+ y\u0131l dayanacak \u015fekilde paslanmaya dayan\u0131kl\u0131d\u0131r.\n\n<\/li>\n<li> \u00c7ok ama\u00e7l\u0131 aktif karbon kartu\u015flar\u0131m\u0131z iki y\u0131la kadar dayan\u0131r. Bu, daha az de\u011fi\u015ftirme ve litre ba\u015f\u0131na daha d\u00fc\u015f\u00fck maliyet anlam\u0131na gelir.\n<br>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>",
            "headingtext_037i333bcuod_html": "Muslukta daha kalitelisini tadabilirsiniz.",
            "buttoncontent_awcs2j2f8h_html": "Sat\u0131n Alma \u0130\u015flemini Tamamla",
            "headingtext_j5rk9bbw2l_html": "En \u0130yi Filtrasyon",
            "title0_7bivs8fk8r5_html": "%99,9'unu kald\u0131r\u0131r<br> kirleticilerin",
            "title0_hy0bfeafq_html": "En y\u00fcksek dereceli<br> paslanmaz \u00e7elik",
            "title0_j4et0rugxvl_html": "Do\u011fal olarak aktive edildi<br> karbon filtrasyonu",
            "title0_yog81uuo1j_html": "Gezegen dostu<br> ar\u0131nma",
            "title0_y2i0bvbvijq_html": "Taze tad\u0131n<br> g\u00fcvenebilirsin",
            "title0_8kxeenei6u3_html": "10 y\u0131l garanti, 100 g\u00fcn<br> para iade garantisi",
            "ecomiconlisttitle0_ecomwx6prxol82a_wx6prxol82a_html": "Taze, besin a\u00e7\u0131s\u0131ndan zengin su, akarsulardan kamusal su sistemlerine ak\u0131yor.",
            "ecomiconlisttitle0_ecomxowb6xmhsr_xowb6xmhsr_html": "A\u011f\u0131r metaller, parazitler, kimyasal at\u0131klar, pestisitler ve daha fazlas\u0131 dahil olmak \u00fczere kirleticilere maruz kalmaktad\u0131r.",
            "ecomiconlisttitle0_ecomcm3ogc2unm5_cm3ogc2unm5_html": "Phoenix Yer\u00e7ekimi Filtresi, en y\u00fcksek kaliteli hindistan cevizi kabuklar\u0131ndan \u00fcretilen aktif karbon kartu\u015flar\u0131 arac\u0131l\u0131\u011f\u0131yla musluk suyunu ar\u0131t\u0131r",
            "ecomiconlisttitle0_ecom6q6mr9xl4xv_6q6mr9xl4xv_html": "Yo\u011fun, g\u00f6zenekli duvar, suyunuzun oksijen veya mineral i\u00e7eri\u011fini de\u011fi\u015ftirmeden kirleticilerin %99,99'unu giderir.",
            "ecomiconlisttitle0_ecomcqij76ged76_cqij76ged76_html": "Siz ve sevdikleriniz, do\u011fan\u0131n tasarlad\u0131\u011f\u0131 gibi, taze ve besin a\u00e7\u0131s\u0131ndan zengin suyun tad\u0131n\u0131 kolayca \u00e7\u0131kar\u0131n",
            "headingtext_ej9r82f3z6w_html": "Phoenix Fark\u0131",
            "textcontent_tluznympyp_html": "\u00dc\u00e7 a\u015famal\u0131 aktif karbon kartu\u015flar\u0131m\u0131z, maksimum yeniden kullan\u0131m ve minimum de\u011fi\u015ftirme i\u00e7in tasarlanm\u0131\u015ft\u0131r ve 18 aya kadar dayan\u0131r.\n",
            "ecomiconlisttitle0_ecomfzvzfq01u0c_fzvzfq01u0c_html": "Su filtrenizi 100 g\u00fcn i\u00e7inde be\u011fenmezseniz paran\u0131z\u0131n tamam\u0131n\u0131 iade ediyoruz.",
            "buttoncontent_a0fzy4g3jjq_html": "\u0130ade Politikas\u0131",
            "headingtext_7r1lng6wjij_html": "SSS",
            "item_title_0_obyhwb3w3en_html": "Phoenix Gravity Filtresi plastik s\u00fcrahiler veya di\u011fer filtrelerle kar\u015f\u0131la\u015ft\u0131r\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda nas\u0131ld\u0131r?",
            "item_title_1_obyhwb3w3en_html": "Kendim kurabilir miyim?",
            "item_title_2_obyhwb3w3en_html": "Filtremi temizleyebilir miyim?",
            "textcontent_o41lz187f0t_html": "Kesinlikle. Phoenix Gravity Mini, dakikalar i\u00e7inde kolayca kendin yap kurulumu i\u00e7in tasarlanm\u0131\u015ft\u0131r; tesisat\u00e7\u0131, elektrik\u00e7i veya \u00f6n bilgi gerektirmez. Phoenix Gravity Mini'nizle kartu\u015funuzu nas\u0131l dolduraca\u011f\u0131n\u0131za dair ayr\u0131nt\u0131l\u0131 talimatlar\u0131n yan\u0131 s\u0131ra talimatlar da g\u00f6nderece\u011fiz.<div><br><\/div>",
            "textcontent_icztbf9rrkg_html": "Evet, \u00e7ok basit! Filtrenizi evinizde musluk suyu ve yumu\u015fak bir f\u0131r\u00e7a veya hafif bir a\u015f\u0131nd\u0131r\u0131c\u0131 kullanarak kolayca temizleyebilirsiniz. Phoenix Yer\u00e7ekimi Filtrenizi g\u00f6nderdi\u011fimizde ayr\u0131nt\u0131l\u0131 talimatlar da ekleyece\u011fiz.\n<div><br><\/div>",
            "headingtext_4wkcs3z1d7m_html": "Hala akl\u0131n\u0131za tak\u0131lan bir soru mu var? SSS b\u00f6l\u00fcm\u00fcm\u00fcz\u00fcn tamam\u0131na <a href=\"\/pages\/faq\">buradan ula\u015fabilirsiniz.<\/a>",
            "headingtext_7yt4sozijtk_html": "Phoenix fark\u0131, do\u011frudan kaynaktan."
        },
