            "textcontent_yu829nbfbu_html": "<ul>\n<li> 1 x 8L Yenilenmi\u015f 304 dereceli Paslanmaz \u00c7elik g\u00f6vde \u00fcnitesi<\/li>\n<li> 1 x 304 kalite paslanmaz \u00e7elik musluk<br>\n<\/li> <li>2 x Ak\u0131ll\u0131 Karbon kartu\u015f<br>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>",
            "headingtext_a6trs2n2jv_html": "\u0130ste\u011fe ba\u011fl\u0131 ekstralar:",
            "text_week_tus8q6qwyt_html": "[%-W] hafta%!W",
