            "item_title_2_obyhwb3w3en_html": "Kendim kurabilir miyim?",
            "item_title_3_obyhwb3w3en_html": "Phoenix Gravity Filtresi plastik s\u00fcrahiler veya di\u011fer filtrelerle kar\u015f\u0131la\u015ft\u0131r\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda nas\u0131ld\u0131r?",
            "textcontent_gg1isp4q3jm_html": "Bu, Phoenix Gravity Su Filtrenizi ka\u00e7 ki\u015finin kullanaca\u011f\u0131na ba\u011fl\u0131d\u0131r ve\n Ne kadar su i\u00e7ti\u011finizi d\u00fc\u015f\u00fcn\u00fcn! Genel olarak \u015funlar\u0131 \u00f6neriyoruz:<div> 6 Litre - 1-2 ki\u015fiye kadar m\u00fckemmel uyum<\/div>\n<div> 8 Litre - Ortada, 2-4 ki\u015fiye kadar<\/div>\n<div> 12 Litre - Aile dostu, 3-4+ ki\u015fi i\u00e7in<div><\/div>\n<\/div>",
            "textcontent_lgtnfy638n_html": "<b>Yer\u00e7ekimi Filtresi:<\/b> Il\u0131k sabunlu su ve a\u015f\u0131nd\u0131r\u0131c\u0131 olmayan bir bez veya s\u00fcnger kullanarak elde y\u0131kaman\u0131z\u0131 \u00f6neririz. Ard\u0131ndan, havayla kurumaya b\u0131rak\u0131n veya mikrofiber bir bezle parlat\u0131n. (\u00d6nce kartu\u015flar\u0131n\u0131z\u0131 \u00e7\u0131karmay\u0131 unutmay\u0131n!)<div><br><\/div> <div>\n<b>Kartu\u015flar:<\/b> Bunlar\u0131 yaln\u0131zca so\u011fuk akan su alt\u0131nda y\u0131kay\u0131n ve hafif a\u015f\u0131nd\u0131r\u0131c\u0131 bir ovma teli veya f\u0131r\u00e7a kullanarak, kirlenmeyi \u00f6nlemek i\u00e7in yaln\u0131zca yuvadan uca do\u011fru kartu\u015flar\u0131 hafif\u00e7e masaj yap\u0131n.<\/div>\n<div><br><\/div>\n<div> <b>POSTreat:<\/b> Yine \u0131l\u0131k sabunlu su ve a\u015f\u0131nd\u0131r\u0131c\u0131 olmayan bir bez\/s\u00fcnger kullan\u0131n. Ard\u0131ndan, havayla kurumaya b\u0131rak\u0131n veya mikrofiber bir bezle parlat\u0131n. (\u00d6nce medyay\u0131 \u00e7\u0131karmay\u0131 unutmay\u0131n!)<div> <a href=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0735\/1821\/9557\/files\/Phoenix_Gravity___Carbon_cartridge.pdf?v=1693476936\"><font color=\"#f1d14e\"><\/font><\/a>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>",
            "textcontent_qbh7mgpg8xr_html": "Elbette! Sistemlerimiz son derece kolay monte edilecek \u015fekilde tasarlanm\u0131\u015ft\u0131r ve ihtiyac\u0131n\u0131z olan her \u015fey dahildir. Sadece ellerinizi kullanarak kendiniz yapabilirsiniz; \u00f6zel aletlere, tesisat\u00e7\u0131lara veya elektrik\u00e7ilere ihtiyac\u0131n\u0131z yoktur.<div><br><\/div>\n<div> Her \u00fcniteye eksiksiz talimatlar ekliyoruz ve her zaman yard\u0131mc\u0131 olmak i\u00e7in buraday\u0131z. Bizimle <a href=\"\/pages\/help-center\"><font color=\"#f1d14e\">buradan ileti\u015fime ge\u00e7ebilirsiniz.<\/font><\/a><a href=\"\/pages\/help-center\"><font color=\"#f1d14e\"><\/font><\/a>\n<\/div>",
