            "title0_lpa8cxshpcd_html": "Kullan\u0131m\u0131 Kolay",
            "text0_lpa8cxshpcd_html": "Basit ve kullan\u0131c\u0131 dostu",
            "title0_z2ybn04zuo_html": "Uzun \u00f6m\u00fcrl\u00fc filtreli mumlar",
            "text0_z2ybn04zuo_html": "Uzun s\u00fcreli kullan\u0131m i\u00e7in temizlenebilir ve yeniden kullan\u0131labilir",
            "title0_htrjz6x7lli_html": "Kan\u0131tlanm\u0131\u015f koruma",
            "text0_htrjz6x7lli_html": "Su kaynakl\u0131 hastal\u0131klara kar\u015f\u0131",
            "title0_0nq2x22nkvlr_html": "Kald\u0131r\u0131r",
            "text0_0nq2x22nkvlr_html": "Yayg\u0131n kirleticilerin %99,99'undan fazlas\u0131n\u0131 filtreler ve bakterileri yok eder",
            "title0_ei1y1igytv_html": "Flor\u00fcr giderimi",
            "text0_ei1y1igytv_html": "POSTreat Flor\u00fcr Giderme kartu\u015fumuz",
            "title0_h4gozfvf1f6_html": "Filtre \u00d6mr\u00fc",
            "text0_h4gozfvf1f6_html": "20000 Litreye kadar",
            "title0_i2wf5vxswae_html": "Kendin yap",
            "text0_i2wf5vxswae_html": "Kolay kurulum, tesisat gerektirmez, kendi kendini de\u011fi\u015ftirir",
            "title0_1nm6by565uo_html": "Kimyasal \u0130\u00e7ermez",
