            "title0_ht8vzxevtd_html": "Flor\u00fcr",
            "headingtext_dp64ifnp0me_html": "Phoenix Gravity Su Filtresi Sa\u011fl\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131z ve Tasarruflar\u0131n\u0131z \u00dczerinde Nas\u0131l Olumlu Bir Etki Yarat\u0131r?",
            "title0_334k18eb2hb_html": "Elektrik Gerekmez",
            "text0_334k18eb2hb_html": "\u0130leri teknolojimizle, elektrik ihtiyac\u0131 olmadan \u00e7al\u0131\u015fan ve kurulum an\u0131ndan itibaren rakipsiz tasarruf sa\u011flayan bir filtreyi gururla sunuyoruz.",
            "title0_du63ez8jhp8_html": "S\u0131f\u0131r Su \u0130sraf\u0131",
            "text0_du63ez8jhp8_html": "Devrim niteli\u011findeki filtreleme sistemimiz, ar\u0131tma i\u015flemi s\u0131ras\u0131nda tek bir damla suyun bile bo\u015fa gitmemesini sa\u011flayarak, suyu en ba\u015f\u0131ndan itibaren koruma konusunda ger\u00e7ek bir \u015fampiyon haline getiriyor.",
            "title0_wwzeef07liq_html": "Kal\u0131c\u0131 M\u00fckemmellik",
            "text0_wwzeef07liq_html": "Filtrelerimiz bulan\u0131k suda kullan\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda temizlenebildi\u011fi i\u00e7in uzun \u00f6m\u00fcrl\u00fcd\u00fcr",
            "title0_p3cmeueldb_html": "Do\u011fal Mineraller Korundu",
            "text0_p3cmeueldb_html": "Phoenix Gravity Su filtreleri sa\u011fl\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131z i\u00e7in faydal\u0131 olan t\u00fcm do\u011fal mineralleri korur.",
            "title0_d615prd4i8s_html": "Nihai Patojen \u0130mhas\u0131",
            "text0_d615prd4i8s_html": "Par\u00e7ac\u0131klara ve Patojenlere Kar\u015f\u0131 Maksimum Filtrasyon Korumas\u0131 i\u00e7in 0,2 Mikronluk Rakipsiz G\u00f6zenek Yap\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 Ortaya \u00c7\u0131kar\u0131r",
            "title0_wl2gpi12gea_html": "\u00c7ok A\u015famal\u0131 Ar\u0131tma",
            "text0_wl2gpi12gea_html": "E.Coli, Giardia, Cryptosporidium, Teriganna, Shigella, Salmonella Typhii ve Vibrio Cholera'n\u0131n %99,99'undan fazlas\u0131n\u0131 giderir. Ayr\u0131ca Klor, Kur\u015fun ve Kloraminlerin %95'inden fazlas\u0131n\u0131 giderir.",
            "view_more_link0_hslsycj1aid_html": "Ayr\u0131nt\u0131lar\u0131 G\u00f6r\u00fcnt\u00fcle",
            "view_more_link1_hslsycj1aid_html": "Ayr\u0131nt\u0131lar\u0131 G\u00f6r\u00fcnt\u00fcle",
            "view_more_link2_hslsycj1aid_html": "Ayr\u0131nt\u0131lar\u0131 G\u00f6r\u00fcnt\u00fcle",
            "view_more_link3_hslsycj1aid_html": "Ayr\u0131nt\u0131lar\u0131 G\u00f6r\u00fcnt\u00fcle",
            "textcontent_6b0zss2ado8_html": "G\u00d6R\u00dcN\u00dcM K\u0130TABI",
            "headingtext_tod9ys13csi_html": "<div> Phoenix Su Filtreleme Sistemi<\/div>",
            "textcontent_im5q34vsm9_html": "Morbi mattis neque scelerisque aliquam at ut venenatis. Egestas, k\u00f6t\u00fc muameleye maruz kalan bir adamd\u0131r. Ba\u015fka yerde belirtilmemi\u015f, tamsay\u0131 condimentum mauris et nunc nec Phasellus pellentesque.",
            "buttoncontent_8nudpq6viwt_html": "\u015e\u0130MD\u0130 ALI\u015eVER\u0130\u015e YAPIN",
            "headingtext_kwsmiu2xbrj_html": "Nas\u0131l \u00c7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r?",
            "headingtext_lxo0ojfe51p_html": "Phoenix Su Filtresi Neden Daha \u0130yidir?",
            "headingtext_gv9v6gd1god_html": "\u00c7ok Kullan\u0131ml\u0131 Senaryolar",
            "textcontent_0vnkv9sj8ksd_html": "Phoenix yer\u00e7ekimi beslemeli su filtreleme sistemi, evde, yurtta ve karavanda, seyahat ederken, kamp yaparken veya bal\u0131k tutarken d\u0131\u015far\u0131da nerede olursan\u0131z olun tatl\u0131 su ihtiya\u00e7lar\u0131n\u0131z\u0131 kar\u015f\u0131lamak \u00fczere tasarlanm\u0131\u015ft\u0131r.",
            "headingtext_xqml1c69w9_html": "M\u00fc\u015fterilerimiz Ne Diyor?\n Phoenix Hakk\u0131nda",
            "text0_erhhyrj9v6_html": "<b><font color=\"#1d5d9b\">\"<\/font><\/b> Harika tad\u0131 olan su <b><font color=\"#1d5d9b\">\"<\/font><\/b>",
            "text1_erhhyrj9v6_html": "<font color=\"#1d5d9b\">\u201c<\/font> \u0130yi \u00dcr\u00fcn <font color=\"#1d5d9b\">\u201d<\/font>",
            "text2_erhhyrj9v6_html": "<font color=\"#1d5d9b\">\"<\/font> \u00c7ok Mutlu <font color=\"#1d5d9b\">\"<\/font>",
            "headingtext_kjzl8qavse_html": "Neden Phoenix?",
            "headingtext_7szddhi6gyi_html": "Taze olan\u0131 seveceksiniz<div> do\u011fal suyumuzun tad\u0131<br>\n<\/div>",
            "ecomiconlisttitle0_ecom54tryn3difs_54tryn3difs_html": "Y\u00fcksek Kalite",
            "ecomiconlistdes_0_ecom54tryn3difs_54tryn3difs_html": "\"Eleifend ultricies semper convallis pulvinar risus non netus est sapien. Posuere id enim egestas diam. Quis egestas nam.\"",
            "ecomiconlisttitle0_ecom75qrwoui9om_75qrwoui9om_html": " G\u00fcvenilir",
            "ecomiconlistdes_0_ecom75qrwoui9om_75qrwoui9om_html": "\"Eleifend ultricies semper convallis pulvinar risus non netus est sapien. Posuere id enim egestas diam. Quis egestas nam.\"",
            "ecomiconlisttitle0_ecomfk47et4q2n6_fk47et4q2n6_html": "Y\u00fcksek Kalite",
            "ecomiconlistdes_0_ecomfk47et4q2n6_fk47et4q2n6_html": "\"Eleifend ultricies semper convallis pulvinar risus non netus est sapien. Posuere id enim egestas diam. Quis egestas nam.\"",
            "ecomiconlisttitle0_ecomhmecqovcsb_hmecqovcsb_html": "Y\u00fcksek Kalite",
            "ecomiconlistdes_0_ecomhmecqovcsb_hmecqovcsb_html": "\"Eleifend ultricies semper convallis pulvinar risus non netus est sapien. Posuere id enim egestas diam. Quis egestas nam.\"",
            "ecomiconlisttitle0_ecompzqek1i9l2o_pzqek1i9l2o_html": "Y\u00fcksek Kalite",
            "ecomiconlistdes_0_ecompzqek1i9l2o_pzqek1i9l2o_html": "\"Eleifend ultricies semper convallis pulvinar risus non netus est sapien. Posuere id enim egestas diam. Quis egestas nam.\"",
            "ecomiconlisttitle0_ecomf0z1fcatxr_f0z1fcatxr_html": "Y\u00fcksek Kalite",
            "ecomiconlistdes_0_ecomf0z1fcatxr_f0z1fcatxr_html": "\"Eleifend ultricies semper convallis pulvinar risus non netus est sapien. Posuere id enim egestas diam. Quis egestas nam.\"",
            "headingtext_gncsc1mpils_html": "Ailenizi En \u0130yi Su Filtreleme Sistemlerinden Biriyle Koruyun.",
            "ecomiconlisttitle0_ecombe2zkav65ne_be2zkav65ne_html": "Sa\u011fl\u0131k Koruma",
            "ecomiconlistdes_0_ecombe2zkav65ne_be2zkav65ne_html": "Bakteriler, vir\u00fcsler, a\u011f\u0131r metaller ve kimyasallar gibi su kaynakl\u0131 kirleticiler, mide-ba\u011f\u0131rsak sorunlar\u0131, cilt tahri\u015fleri ve uzun vadeli hastal\u0131klar gibi \u00e7e\u015fitli sa\u011fl\u0131k sorunlar\u0131na yol a\u00e7abilir.",
            "ecomiconlisttitle1_ecombe2zkav65ne_be2zkav65ne_html": "\u00c7evresel Faydalar",
            "ecomiconlistdes_1_ecombe2zkav65ne_be2zkav65ne_html": "Su filtreleme sistemi kullanarak \u015fi\u015felenmi\u015f suya olan ihtiyac\u0131n\u0131z\u0131 azalt\u0131rs\u0131n\u0131z, bu da plastik at\u0131klar\u0131n ve \u00e7evresel etkilerinin azalt\u0131lmas\u0131na yard\u0131mc\u0131 olur.",
            "ecomiconlisttitle2_ecombe2zkav65ne_be2zkav65ne_html": "Uzun Vadeli Tasarruflar",
            "ecomiconlistdes_2_ecombe2zkav65ne_be2zkav65ne_html": "Su filtrasyon sistemi sat\u0131n almak ve kurmak ba\u015flang\u0131\u00e7ta bir yat\u0131r\u0131m gerektirse de, \u015fi\u015felenmi\u015f suya olan ihtiyac\u0131n\u0131z\u0131 ve su kaynakl\u0131 hastal\u0131klarla ilgili potansiyel sa\u011fl\u0131k harcamalar\u0131n\u0131 azaltarak uzun vadede tasarruf etmenizi sa\u011flayabilir.",
            "headingtext_fs6hsl87qho_html": "G\u00fcvenilir Bir \u0130sim<div> Yer\u00e7ekimi Su Filtresi End\u00fcstrisi<\/div>",
            "title0_xqtps9shsv_html": "Maksimum Safl\u0131k",
            "text0_xqtps9shsv_html": "Suyun hayat\u0131m\u0131zdaki \u00f6neminden dolay\u0131 m\u00fc\u015fterilerimize %99,99 saf su veriyoruz.",
            "title1_xqtps9shsv_html": "2 Ad\u0131ml\u0131 Filtrasyon",
            "text1_xqtps9shsv_html": "Suda farkl\u0131 t\u00fcrde kirlilikler bulunur. 2 a\u015famal\u0131 filtrasyon, suyun t\u00fcm kirlili\u011fini giderir.",
            "title2_xqtps9shsv_html": "Klorsuz",
            "text2_xqtps9shsv_html": "M\u00fc\u015fterilerimizin hayat\u0131n\u0131 d\u00fc\u015f\u00fcnerek suyumuza kloru \u00fccretsiz olarak veriyoruz, \u00e7\u00fcnk\u00fc klor sa\u011fl\u0131\u011f\u0131m\u0131za ciddi zararlar veriyor.",
            "title3_xqtps9shsv_html": "Kalite Sertifikal\u0131",
            "text3_xqtps9shsv_html": "Suyumuzun safl\u0131\u011f\u0131 nedeniyle su kalitemiz bir\u00e7ok \u00fclkede sertifikaland\u0131r\u0131lm\u0131\u015ft\u0131r.",
            "headingtext_9e6rokyudts_html": "Her Zaman G\u00fcvende Olmak \u0130stiyoruz<div> ve Sa\u011fl\u0131kl\u0131 Su i\u00e7in<\/div>\n<div> Sa\u011fl\u0131kl\u0131 Ya\u015fam.<\/div>",
            "textcontent_5oi1cyskjln_html": "Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit, sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt ut Labore et dolore magna aliqua. En az\u0131ndan en az \u00e7abayla, \u00e7ok fazla \u00e7aba gerektiren bir egzersiz, her \u015feyden \u00f6nce m\u00fcmk\u00fcn olan en iyi egzersizdir.",
            "textcontent_5gmz2nrdr8i_html": "Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit, sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt ut Labore et dolore magna aliqua. En az\u0131ndan en az \u00e7abayla, \u00e7ok fazla \u00e7aba gerektiren bir egzersiz, her \u015feyden \u00f6nce m\u00fcmk\u00fcn olan en iyi egzersizdir.",
            "headingtext_ahuas6hj505_html": "S\u0131k\u00e7a Sorulan Sorular",
            "itemtitle0_bhwgcp7e7od_html": "Kutuda neler var?",
            "itemtitle1_bhwgcp7e7od_html": "100 g\u00fcnl\u00fck Deneme nas\u0131l \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r?",
            "itemtitle2_bhwgcp7e7od_html": "Phoenix Gravity suyun i\u00e7indeki mineralleri nas\u0131l koruyor?",
            "itemtitle3_bhwgcp7e7od_html": "Bu, RO sistemleriyle nas\u0131l kar\u015f\u0131la\u015ft\u0131r\u0131l\u0131r? RO'dan daha m\u0131 iyi?",
            "itemtitle4_bhwgcp7e7od_html": "Phoenix Carbon ar\u0131tma kartu\u015fu t\u0131kand\u0131\u011f\u0131nda ne olur?",
            "itemtitle5_bhwgcp7e7od_html": "Hangi kapasiteyi se\u00e7melisiniz?",
            "textcontent_34nma4tdfsv_html": "<ul>\n<li> 1 x Paslanmaz \u00c7elik \u00dcst B\u00f6lme<\/li>\n<li><div> 1 x Paslanmaz \u00c7elik Alt B\u00f6lme<br>\n<\/div><\/li>\n<li><div> 1 x Paslanmaz \u00c7elik Kapak<br>\n<\/div><\/li>\n<li><div> 2 x Phoenix Karbon ar\u0131tma<br>\n<\/div><\/li>\n<li><div> 1 x Vida ve rondelal\u0131 d\u00fc\u011fme<br>\n<\/div><\/li>\n<li><div> 1 x SS Musluk (G\u0131da s\u0131n\u0131f\u0131)<br>\n<\/div><\/li>\n<li><div> 1 x Kau\u00e7uk Kaymaz Taban Halkas\u0131<br>\n<\/div><\/li>\n<li><div> Ekstra filtre ba\u011flant\u0131 noktas\u0131 kartu\u015flar\u0131n\u0131 t\u0131kamak i\u00e7in 2 adet \u00f6nceden tak\u0131lm\u0131\u015f Silikon Bloker<\/div><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<div><\/div>",
            "textcontent_ct7m29f2di9_html": "<ul>\n<li> Phoenix Gravity Su Filtresi sistemini sat\u0131n al\u0131n<\/li>\n<li> Phoenix Gravity Su filtreleme sistemini 100 g\u00fcne kadar kullan\u0131n.<\/li>\n<li> Bekledi\u011finiz en iyi suyu \u00fcretmezse, hi\u00e7bir soru sorulmadan tam para iadesi i\u00e7in bize geri g\u00f6nderin.<\/li>\n<li> Orijinal ambalaj\u0131 ve t\u00fcm par\u00e7alar\u0131yla birlikte iade edin. \u00c7elik g\u00f6vdede ezik, kartu\u015flarda \u00e7atlak veya k\u0131r\u0131k olmamal\u0131d\u0131r.<br>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>",
            "textcontent_bkplt3b7qwg_html": "Phoenix Gravity'nin ar\u0131tma teknolojisinin en b\u00fcy\u00fck avantaj\u0131, suyunuzdaki patojenik bakteriler, vir\u00fcsler ve kistler gibi zararl\u0131 kirleticileri ve klor, kur\u015fun, a\u011f\u0131r metaller, u\u00e7ucu organik bile\u015fikler (VOC), pestisitler gibi kimyasal kirleticileri filtrelemesi, sodyum, potasyum, kalsiyum ve di\u011fer mineraller gibi do\u011fal olarak bulunan mineral maddelerin ise bozulmadan kalmas\u0131na izin vermesidir.",
            "textcontent_sbvvepj4l6e_html": "Musluk suyu olan hemen hemen t\u00fcm haneler i\u00e7in, ters ozmoz (RO) kullan\u0131m\u0131 gereksizdir ve suyunuzun yar\u0131s\u0131ndan fazlas\u0131n\u0131 bo\u015fa harcad\u0131\u011f\u0131 i\u00e7in \u00f6nerilmez. Bir ters ozmoz sistemi, suyunuzu yaln\u0131zca zararl\u0131 kirleticilerden ar\u0131nd\u0131rmakla kalmaz, ayn\u0131 zamanda v\u00fccudunuz i\u00e7in faydal\u0131 mineralleri de giderir. Phoenix Gravity, TDS de\u011feri 250'nin alt\u0131nda olan sular\u0131 ar\u0131tmak i\u00e7in m\u00fckemmeldir. Genellikle sadece derin kuyulardan gelen sularda oldu\u011fu gibi, TDS de\u011feri 750'nin \u00fczerinde olan sular i\u00e7in bir ters ozmoz sistemi \u00f6nerilir.",
            "textcontent_molci3mrvgd_html": "Kartu\u015flar\u0131 kullanmaya devam ettik\u00e7e, g\u00f6zenekleri t\u0131kan\u0131rsa veya kurursa, filtrasyon h\u0131zlar\u0131 \u00e7ok yava\u015flayabilir ve rahats\u0131z edici hale gelebilir. Bu, giren suya ba\u011fl\u0131 olarak 3 ay ile bir y\u0131l aras\u0131nda de\u011fi\u015febilir. Kartu\u015flar\u0131 temizlemek i\u00e7in, filtrelenmemi\u015f suyun alt hazneye d\u00f6k\u00fclmedi\u011finden emin olarak \u00fcst hazneden \u00e7\u0131kar\u0131n. Her kartu\u015fu akan musluk suyu alt\u0131nda yumu\u015fak bir f\u0131r\u00e7a veya hafif bir a\u015f\u0131nd\u0131r\u0131c\u0131 kullanarak f\u0131r\u00e7alay\u0131n. Yuvay\u0131 kirletmemeye dikkat ederek, daima di\u015fli yuvas\u0131ndan uza\u011fa do\u011fru f\u0131r\u00e7alay\u0131n. Asla sabun veya deterjan kullanmay\u0131n.",
            "textcontent_ba8zkpqusm9_html": "M\u00fc\u015fterilerimizin hane halk\u0131 b\u00fcy\u00fckl\u00fc\u011f\u00fcne g\u00f6re tercih ettikleri en yayg\u0131n kapasiteler a\u015fa\u011f\u0131daki gibidir:<div><ul>\n<li> 6 Litre - 2 ki\u015fiye kadar<\/li>\n<li> 8 Litre \u2013 4 ki\u015fiye kadar<\/li>\n<li> 12 Litre \u2013 6 ki\u015fiye kadar<br>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul><\/div>"
        },
